+## What sleep-period measurements represent
+
+During sleep, the devices are not worn at their nominal near-eye and chest
+positions. Values recorded during the sleep period therefore describe the
+bedside sleep environment. They are not interpreted as light measured on the
+body at the usual waking sensor positions.
